items.notes:
Found in and around wells of Night Harbor, only at night :
* Leave Night Harbor from the West Gate ;
* Continue walking forward and slightly to the left ;
* Once you locate the small ruins with the [[a shifty gnome|shifty gnome]], continue further west towards the green tower in the distance ;
* The well is behind a ruined wall nearby to the shifty gnome.
Once near the well :
* type "/look" to see "The well's crumbling exterior betrays its age, appearing as old as the nearby ruins."
* Type "/take moss" to receive Moondew Moss in your inventory.
